    "title: \"12. CI/CD: build, scan, deploy\"\n",
    "categories: []\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "GitHub Actions builds, scans, and deploys every image by digest, authenticating to Azure via OIDC. CI never schedules or orchestrates workflows; that remains the job platform's responsibility.\n"
